our future financial performance;

our ability to scale our platform, manage our growth and expand our operations;

anticipated trends in our business and the faith and flourishing ecosystem;

our future acquisitions and investments;

our ability to continue as a going concern;

our ability to remediate material weaknesses in our internal control over financial reporting;

our ability to raise additional capital;

our ability to retain and expand our customer base;

our ability to remain competitive;

our ability to develop new products and enhance our platform;

our ability to retain our senior management team and attract talented employees;

